  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Customs Sector Development in the Pacific 2023-28</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Customs Sector Development in the Pacific enables a team of NZ Customs technical experts in trade facilitation, border management, and leadership development to deploy across the Pacific. These experts provide advice, training and support to Pacific Customs administrations in Fiji, Samoa, Cook Islands and Vanuatu, as well as broad support for the region as a whole.</narrative>
  </description>
